{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>近日網上流傳一段影片，女團IdG Bubbles成員莊嘉詠（Anesa）在一次公開活動的場外，獲粉絲送上遊戲機及實體遊戲大禮，令她當場感動落淚。</p><p>粉絲貼心送上《GTA》與PS5主機</p><p>影片開始時，一名粉絲率先遞上一盒《Grand Theft Auto VI》（GTA 6）的實體遊戲光碟，莊嘉詠接過後表現驚喜。隨後，該名粉絲詢問她：「Sony冇送比你咩？」莊嘉詠搖頭否認後，粉絲隨即表示：「咁我送比你呀！」並從黃色膠袋中拿出一部全新的PS5遊戲主機。現場隨即傳出其他粉絲「嘩」聲四起的驚嘆聲。</p><figure><img alt=\"首先係送上遊戲。（片段截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201558329181474816931706.jpeg/_-TDHNDWCWA6HGjZ09lfeS9bfGjjIDzNllJ5JpZSeSY\"/><figcaption>首先係送上遊戲。（片段截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"跟住係PS5。（片段截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201558326647984128028635.jpeg/ksgkAv0BLFvQP2nJJZcGYTSj0AW7qcpB9MokefTKJHk\"/><figcaption>跟住係PS5。（片段截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"跟住係PS5。（片段截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201558324085133312012793.jpeg/9CNfrGS8xQ97j4fBcqOK9Ie6_7dhDqEBCD8tUQg_LVE\"/><figcaption>跟住係PS5。（片段截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"莊嘉詠好震驚。（片段截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201558321547448320243759.jpeg/9t_k3odLNjctSQUHl4HNQA3Lg736pYu0uuFWErrhVhI\"/><figcaption>莊嘉詠好震驚。（片段截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>偶像激動落淚 粉絲遞紙巾安慰</p><p>莊嘉詠看到PS5主機後，震驚得立刻用手掩面，隨後更激動落淚。送禮的粉絲見狀，連忙安慰道：「唔好喊啦！」並遞上紙巾讓她拭淚。該名粉絲其後解釋送禮的原因：「你前日話想玩，但冇機，所以我想要送比你。」這番說話展現了粉絲對偶像日前的言論相當上心。</p><figure><img alt=\"當街喊了。（片段截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201559099020939264703215.jpeg/X88NfcjhExtYmmlpKG-oH8ArAF7aurBwhcfiSoXH4ko\"/><figcaption>當街喊了。（片段截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"當街喊了。（片段截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201559096646832128316725.jpeg/4mGsxuQ8-nr72cpkv57ZPf3-e1XV1KXUR6aEyUemhMk\"/><figcaption>當街喊了。（片段截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"當街喊了。（片段截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201559094201421824891654.jpeg/I_mOPtk-RhS5MKvCrtlgLYYlfPtIgYluzsnbyc7J28k\"/><figcaption>當街喊了。（片段截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貼心粉絲遞上紙巾。（片段截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201559091739234304834921.jpeg/_p0oIagSfzjLlg1mubAwnJEX_p1B2w6p2Nh70tjYe9I\"/><figcaption>貼心粉絲遞上紙巾。（片段截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貼心粉絲遞上紙巾。（片段截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201559089302212608783216.jpeg/KJqdB8M59q6T5qpl1zSoQhJrUSjYqYxXUXxf-FF8X_g\"/><figcaption>貼心粉絲遞上紙巾。（片段截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>主動派心回饋粉絲 場面溫馨</p><p>在情緒稍為平復後，莊嘉詠拿著遊戲光碟及紙巾準備離開，但她隨即轉身，主動向該名送禮的粉絲做出「派心」的手勢以表達謝意。隨後她在人群中繼續前行時，仍面露笑容，氣氛溫馨。整個過程被完整拍下，紀錄了這段粉絲與偶像之間的互動。</p><figure><img alt=\"主動派心回饋粉絲。（片段截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201559274787049472741826.jpeg/96ZV3dVR_CTJ8fiR6lb7m6yKjcdYmVQQfi5VX34uVV8\"/><figcaption>主動派心回饋粉絲。（片段截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"主動派心回饋粉絲。（片段截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201559271892848640013678.jpeg/CCOlZdVw-wJ6pKCglIGzefYkjkjcLQ4Pm_Cb3Zvwm90\"/><figcaption>主動派心回饋粉絲。（片段截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>現年23歲的莊嘉詠（Anesa）為香港索尼音樂旗下廠牌 Green Music 創立之女子偶像育成企劃「Idol Girls 偶像女生」首批出道成員之一。她與陳欣雯（Cindy）、黃小倬、陸曉瑩（Yoyo）等7名成員組成率先亮相的一期生女團「IdG Bubbles」，憑藉派台作品《泡泡我！》及《超級愛！》在本地學界與年輕族群間迅速累積高人氣，其鄰家親民的性格更吸引了一批忠實「鐵粉」長伴左右。</p><figure><img alt=\"莊嘉詠係IdG Bubbles成員。（IG@saa.nesa）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201560386864943104524968.jpeg/oW1k4Vj0BVbq422lm6Kv7VeypbxSJj0Qk_1tBJP9bQQ\"/><figcaption>莊嘉詠係IdG Bubbles成員。（IG@saa.nesa）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"莊嘉詠係IdG Bubbles成員。（IG@saa.nesa）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201560384100765696918430.jpeg/VbtB2e_onkmYbkaOSQhPdPhsbtHa0Aiwrn456q5-Oeo\"/><figcaption>莊嘉詠係IdG Bubbles成員。（IG@saa.nesa）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"莊嘉詠係IdG Bubbles成員。（IG@saa.nesa）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201560381504360448014398.jpeg/4ovqqcV0C3kgb6jXh2fDlvzS58t1bOlpmB0JaJgdCWg\"/><figcaption>莊嘉詠係IdG Bubbles成員。（IG@saa.nesa）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.229027+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":954,"images":14,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T09:00:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T11:17:26.875177+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:23.230441+00:00","content_hash":"ffa18bd5748b9b408dfdbe02c8d52b6dff44780adf399522709a50537b281bd4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}